            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ŵecetani kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, ‘Asagule misinda jakutilila, jinamlamwile Mose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kuti amsalile jemanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwawuleje mjakwe mwa ngosi akukomboleka kwawula kweleko ni kumtila jwele jwakumsosa kuti amwucisyejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanga jwamlume kapena jwamkongwe akukomboleka kutilila ku umo wa jele misindaji, ajawule ku malo gakulamulila magambo pa cipata cakwinjilila mu msinda, ni mkalongosole magambo gakwego kwa acakulungwa ŵa mu msindamo; ni jemanjajo tacimjigala jwalakwejo kwawulaje najo mu msinda, nipo tacimpa malo, ni kutamaga najo mu msindamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga jwakusosa kuwucisya akwakuya jemanjajo kukoko, ŵandu ŵa mu msindawo ngakuŵajilwa kwapeleka jemanjajo kwa ŵelewo. Nambo akuŵajilwa kwacinjilicisya ligongo ŵawuleje mundujo mwangosi ngaŵa mwakupsya mtima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atame mu msindamo mpaka ali alamulidwe panganya soni mpaka pa ndaŵi ja ciwa ca jwali jwamkulungwa jwa ŵakutaga mbopesi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwa jele ndaŵijo: ni jwakuwulagajo akukomboleka kwawula soni kumangwakwe, ni ku musi kuŵatyosile mwakutila kula.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
